{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0dc6b1d6-78d8-81c5-b645-58646425fd4b",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T14:44:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colin McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. I want to report a streetlight that's acting up. It's out by my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:38:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. What's it doing, is it just out, or something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:38:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Flickers. On and off, on and off, all night. Goes dark for a few seconds, then comes back. Been like that a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:38:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is it a pole on the street or one of the ones in a parking lot or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:38:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Street. It's the pole right in front of my place. Wood pole, light on an arm sticking out over the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:38:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "415 Gibbs Avenue. Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:39:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "415 Gibbs Avenue. Let me type that in. [pause] And you said all night, so every night, or just last night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:39:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Few nights now. Started maybe Friday, I think. Last night was the worst. It lights up my bedroom, so I notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll keep you up. Is there a number on the pole? Sometimes there's a little tag with numbers on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:39:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, let me look. [pause] Sorry, hold on a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:39:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:39:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I got somebody walking by here, my supervisor. I'm at work, so I'm gonna keep it down a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:40:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time. I can hear you okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:40:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. So I'm not home right now. I can't see the pole from here. I'd have to check tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:40:27-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. The address should be enough for the crew to find it, since you said it's the one directly in front of the house. Is it on your side of the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:40:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, my side. Right at the edge of the yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:40:55-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. What I'll do is put in a work order for a crew to go check the pole and the fixture. Could be the bulb, could be the wiring, could be the sensor. They'll figure that out up there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:41:20-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you get somebody to look at the pole itself? Not just swap a bulb. I think something's loose in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that. I'll put that they should check the pole and the connections, not just the lamp."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:41:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Appreciate that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, some of the poles on that stretch belong to the utility and not the city. If that's the case, the crew will pass it along to them. Either way it gets looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:42:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the way it goes. Fine by me, long as somebody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:42:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Do you want a call back when it's done, or you just want it fixed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:42:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just fixed is fine. But you can take my number if you need it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:42:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:42:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:42:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0178. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:42:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Colin McCarthy. M-c-C-a-r-t-h-y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:42:53-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Colin. All right, you're in. It's a streetlight flickering at 415 Gibbs Avenue, pole in front of the house, crew to check pole and fixture."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:43:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. How long, you figure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually they get to these within a week or two. Sometimes sooner if it's a quick one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:43:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A week or two. That works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:43:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it gets worse, like it's sparking or the pole's leaning, call us right back, that moves up the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:43:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. It's not doing that. Just the flicker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:43:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:43:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, that's all. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:44:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:44:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
